.SH "NAME"
kylin-nm-sysdbus \- The tool for the kylin-nm
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.B kylin-nm-sysdbus
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
The \fBkylin-nm-sysdbus\fR program is a part of the kylin-nm, It provides auxiliary functions for network proxy and IP conflict detection.
.PP
This manual page documents the \fBkylin-nm-sysdbus\fR command.
.P
